"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","quote":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p014","quote":"鄂侯二年，魯隱公初立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p015","quote":"鄂侯六年卒。曲沃莊伯聞晉鄂侯卒，乃興兵伐晉。周平王使虢公將兵伐曲沃莊伯，莊伯走保曲沃。晉人共立鄂侯子光，是爲哀侯。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","text":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"曲沃桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"胛","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"同版原始標記亦如此，句子不通；不以模型補代字或莊伯名字。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"晉孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin: